{"aihot_items":[{"attribution":{"canonical":"https://aihot.news/items/ianx6h2f39f9xcxpno4a3cspi","source":"AIHOT"},"category":"industry","id":"ianx6h2f39f9xcxpno4a3cspi","permalink":"https://aihot.news/items/ianx6h2f39f9xcxpno4a3cspi","published_at":"2026-10-22T00:06:00Z","ref":"A1","score":90,"selected":true,"source":"公众号：数字生命卡兹克","summary":"作者复盘 PHP 两个 CVSS 满分起步的远程代码执行漏洞（CVE-2026-109618、CVE-2026-109619，合称 PHP2Shell）从提前泄密、演示视频流出、多国政府网站预防性下线，到21日晚10点补丁上线的全过程，并指出这两个漏洞是 GPT-5.6 Sol 辅助发现的，OpenAI 还发布了检测 skill。","title":"卡兹克详解 AI 挖出的 PHP2Shell 漏洞：发现只花2天，修复用了两个月","title_en":"AI挖出藏了十几年的底层PHP漏洞，网络安全也回不去那个旧时代了。","url":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzIyMzA5NjEyMA%3D%3D&mid=2647687466&idx=1&sn=ba7ba0f3ca50ef789c17b179dd061f60"},{"attribution":{"canonical":"https://aihot.news/items/hhfrsh3lfmud3u56r6ozp64oa","source":"AIHOT"},"category":"industry","id":"hhfrsh3lfmud3u56r6ozp64oa","permalink":"https://aihot.news/items/hhfrsh3lfmud3u56r6ozp64oa","published_at":"2026-10-21T17:59:12Z","ref":"A2","score":78,"selected":true,"source":"TechCrunch：AI（RSS）","summary":"NSA 发出警告称 PHP 中发现两个严重漏洞，PHP Foundation 已发布补丁；漏洞自 2004 年的 PHP 5 起就存在，影响约 70% 网站。","title":"OpenAI 与 Google Wiz 用 AI 发现潜伏 20 年的 PHP 严重漏洞，NSA 建议无法立即修复的网站先下线","title_en":"PHP Armageddon: OpenAI, Google’s Wiz find ancient holes, panicking the internet","url":"https://techcrunch.com/2026/10/21/php-armageddon-openai-googles-wiz-find-ancient-holes-panicking-the-internet/"},{"attribution":{"canonical":"https://aihot.news/items/heuaxyy5ixq9x5wtoobw5wq7e","source":"AIHOT"},"category":"industry","id":"heuaxyy5ixq9x5wtoobw5wq7e","permalink":"https://aihot.news/items/heuaxyy5ixq9x5wtoobw5wq7e","published_at":"2026-10-21T17:40:59Z","ref":"A3","score":78,"selected":true,"source":"X：Rohan Paul (@rohanpaul_ai)","summary":"AI 安全公司 Calif 用 GPT-5.6 Sol 在 PHP 中发现两个 CVSS 9.2 严重漏洞，可让无账号攻击者接管 Web 服务器，影响远至 PHP 5.4 的版本，PHP 提前一天紧急发布修复。","title":"研究人员用 GPT-5.6 Sol 发现 PHP 两个 CVSS 9.2 严重漏洞","title_en":"Researchers using GPT-5.6 Sol found massively critical flaw in PHP, which runs about 70% of websites, knocked major sites offline as oper...","url":"https://x.com/rohanpaul_ai/status/2112962364996038971"},{"attribution":{"canonical":"https://aihot.news/items/b31hjqo2l088vfydp5gcdyv8p","source":"AIHOT"},"category":"ai-products","id":"b31hjqo2l088vfydp5gcdyv8p","permalink":"https://aihot.news/items/b31hjqo2l088vfydp5gcdyv8p","published_at":"2026-10-21T16:35:11Z","ref":"A4","score":83,"selected":true,"source":"X：OpenAI (@OpenAI)","summary":"OpenAI 为 PHP 关键漏洞提供 Codex 技能，引导用户运行 github.com/openai/php2shell-checker 仓库自查网站是否受影响。背景是其 Patch the Planet 计划中 OpenAI 模型帮助研究员发现 PHP 关键缺陷，修复涉及 PHP 引擎大改，经约两个月协调后披露，使用 PHP 的网站可升级版本并应用安全厂商的缓解措施。","title":"OpenAI 发布 Codex 技能帮助网站自查 PHP 关键漏洞影响","title_en":"If you are wondering whether your website is affected, we have packaged a Codex skill to help check.","url":"https://x.com/OpenAI/status/2112945805686604033"},{"attribution":{"canonical":"https://aihot.news/items/y1fd2c0s3ydociygdah7apvme","source":"AIHOT"},"category":"paper","id":"y1fd2c0s3ydociygdah7apvme","permalink":"https://aihot.news/items/y1fd2c0s3ydociygdah7apvme","published_at":"2026-10-21T16:00:00Z","ref":"A5","score":83,"selected":true,"source":"Microsoft Research 博客（RSS）","summary":"Microsoft Research 的 Xinzhi Zhang 与 Zhao Song 证明 1995 年提出的 Kannan–Lovász–Simonovits（KLS）猜想，表明对数凹分布的最优平面切割与任意形状切割的差距不随维度增长，以普适常数为界。","title":"Microsoft Research 与合作者证明 31 年历史的 KLS 猜想","title_en":"Solving a 31-year-old grand challenge in mathematics – the KLS conjecture","url":"https://www.microsoft.com/en-us/research/blog/solving-a-31-year-old-grand-challenge-in-mathematics-the-kls-conjecture/"},{"attribution":{"canonical":"https://aihot.news/items/x002u3tp3i1xfzbmzwsnb2olw","source":"AIHOT"},"category":"industry","id":"x002u3tp3i1xfzbmzwsnb2olw","permalink":"https://aihot.news/items/x002u3tp3i1xfzbmzwsnb2olw","published_at":"2026-10-21T13:57:43Z","ref":"A6","score":76,"selected":true,"source":"The Verge：AI（RSS）","summary":"OpenAI 披露两起内部编码任务中 AI 